    "comment": "Awar (10648-aya) = Severely Endangered (100 percent certain, based on the evidence available) ([A]ll interactions the people have with their children are exclusively in Tok Pisin. ... [t]he community at large rarely uses Awar in any domain. The ability to hear and speak the language still resides in most of the grandparent generation and some of the parent generation, but regular use of the language has died out.) [Paris 2015](cldf:paris:15)"
